Jhanjar Guitar Chords a beautiful Punjabi Song, sung by Param Singh and Kamal Kahlon.

Ho pairi [G#]jhanjar paaven

Haan dill tey [A#m]keharr machavein

Akkhaan vich [G#]kaala soorma

Yaaran vich [A#m] vair puaaave (x2)

Teri [C#]wakhri adaawan, sadke jaawan

[G#]Duur kyun jaave

Tainu [C#] kol bula ke haal sunawa

[G#]Dil daa haye

Ho tenu [G#]dilo main chawan [A#m]ni

Ho bairi [G#]palkan bichhawa [A#m] ni

Ho ik [G#] vaari haan keh de menu

Tere har [A#m]bol pugawan ni

Ho pairi [G#]jhanjhar paavein

Haan dil tey [A#m]kehar machavein

Akkhaan vich [G#] kaala soorma

Yaaran vich [A#m]vair puaave (x2)

Gali vich [A#m]hunde charchey

Tera vey [A#m]mundiyan ton [D#m]chharche

Ve tere [G#]laare mukde na

Ve thaate [D#m]kinneyan de [A#m]parchey

Na koyi [A#m] kam te jave

Ghde laave [G#] gali teri de

Jo tere [A#m]ghr nu hoke jaave

Ohio [G#]kamm karide

Vilayato [G#] maame Kahlon [A#m]main

Tere laayi [G#]gift main laaya [A#m]ni

Ho chashma [G#]RayBan da [A#m]laake

Chandigarh [G#]sair karawa [A#m]ni

Pairi [G#]jhanjar paave

Haan dil te [A#m]kehar machavein

Akhaan vich [G#] kaala soorma

Yaaran vich [A#m]vair puaave

Ho dil vich [G#] ghar tu kar gayii

Jawaani [A#m]mundeyan te chadh gayii

Ho tenu jaani [G#]banavegi

Eh jind hun [A#m] fikraan ch sadd gayi

Hunn [C#] bol puga lai

[G#]Jind meri nu na karwa laai

Aaja [C#]pyaar nishani deke chhaley

[G#]Mundiyan bitha lai

Mere [G#]pyaar diyan [A#m]baatan

Apne [G#]dil ch vassa lai [A#m]ni

Ho mummy [G#] daddy nu kh key

Ho gal hunne [A#m] agge wadha lai ni

